    },
    "discount": {
      "note": "The journal's credit figures differ from retail in three independent ways, which is why none of them is carried through: the modules were bought at a discount; the game reports HullValue as the hull WITH its stock fittings (coriolis `retailCost` 37472252) where we quote the bare hull (`hullCost` 35741519); and it gives no `Value` at all to the five modules that came free with the hull, so its ModulesValue counts fewer articles than ours.",
      "sourceHullValue": 37472252,
      "sourceModulesValue": 50785509,
      "sourceRebuy": 4412891,
